// Title: Security Software Discovery - Linux
// ID: c9d8b7fd-78e4-44fe-88f6-599135d46d60
// Status: test
// Level: low
// Author: Daniil Yugoslavskiy, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-19
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1518.001
// Description: Detects usage of system utilities (only grep and egrep for now) to discover security software discovery
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((process.executable endswith "/grep" or process.executable endswith "/egrep") and (process.command_line like "*_nessusd*" or process.command_line like "*_td-agent*" or process.command_line like "*_packetbeat*" or process.command_line like "*_filebeat*" or process.command_line like "*_auditbeat*" or process.command_line like "*_osqueryd*" or process.command_line like "*_cbagentd*" or process.command_line like "*_falcond*"))
